 "fieldData": {
  "awb---faq-data": "<div data-rt-embed-type='true'><div data-rt-embed-type='true'><script> window.awbFAQ = {\"heading\": \"Verification Letter Questions, Answered\", \"items\": [{\"q\": \"What is an employment verification letter?\", \"a\": \"It is a short letter from an employer, signed by HR, confirming that someone works or worked there, with the job title and how long they have held it. Landlords and mortgage lenders ask for one as proof of steady work. Unlike an offer letter, it describes a job the person holds or has left, not one they are about to start.\"}, {\"q\": \"How do I create an employment verification letter?\", \"a\": \"Open with one sentence naming the employee and the purpose of the letter, then give the facts one per line so a lender can scan them. Write \\\"has worked\\\" for a current employee and \\\"worked\\\" with an end date for a former one. To handle requests at volume, Emergent's <a href='https://emergent.sh/ai-form-builder'>AI form builder</a> turns that process into an app where every request becomes a draft for HR to sign.\"}, {\"q\": \"How do I get a letter of employment verification?\", \"a\": \"Ask HR or payroll in writing, naming who the letter is for and the email or portal it should reach. If the employer has an employment verification form or HR portal, use that instead of email. Put the requester's deadline in the first line, because a loan closing will not move for a late letter.\"}, {\"q\": \"How do I request an employment verification letter from HR by email?\", \"a\": \"Write a subject line HR can file, such as \\\"Verification letter for Leif Jessop, needed by June 12\\\". In the body, name the landlord or lender and say whether salary may appear. Attach any form the requester supplied and ask HR to send the signed copy to the requester. A request form built with Emergent asks for those details every time, with no cap on responses.\"}, {\"q\": \"What is an example of employment verification?\", \"a\": \"A signed letter from HR is the most familiar one. Mortgage lenders often send a verification of employment form instead, such as Fannie Mae's Form 1005, which the employer fills in and returns to the lender directly. Some employers answer through The Work Number, an Equifax database.\"}, {\"q\": \"What does an employment verification letter sample look like?\", \"a\": \"It runs about three lines. \\\"To whom it may concern: Vida Darrow has worked at Rookwood Logistics as a Payroll Specialist since March 4, 2022, full time. Questions: Delia Quayle, HR Manager, (555) 014-2290.\\\" Use the legal name payroll holds, even if the person goes by another name at work.\"}, {\"q\": \"What is an income verification form?\", \"a\": \"It is a form on which the employer confirms what someone earns, usually the pay rate and the gross paid so far this year. Lenders and benefit agencies send one when a letter about the job alone is not enough. Some employers call the same document a wage verification form.\"}, {\"q\": \"Can I do an employment verification on myself?\", \"a\": \"Yes, if your employer reports to The Work Number. You can request a free Employment Data Report from Equifax, which shows what verifiers see and who has checked your record. If your employer does not use it, ask HR for a letter addressed to you.\"}, {\"q\": \"How long does it take to get employment verification?\", \"a\": \"Seconds, for a database check: The Work Number answers verifiers instantly, at any hour. A letter from HR has no set turnaround, and a screening company cannot start until the candidate signs the release on its <a href='https://emergent.sh/ai-form-builder/background-check-form'>background check form</a>. When an app built with Emergent drafts each letter from the HR record, the only wait left is the signer.\"}, {\"q\": \"What do employers need for employment verification?\", \"a\": \"Enough to find the right person: a full legal name plus an employee ID or date of birth, and an address for the answer. Payroll usually fills in the pay figures on a wage verification form. Questions about how someone did the job belong on a reference check form, not in a verification.\"}]}; </script></div></div>"
 }
